Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Decree shall enter into force on the date of its promulgation; provided, the amended provisions of Article 3-2, 7, 16, 17, and 64, and Appendices 1, 1-2, and 5 shall enter into force on April 19, 2023.
Article 2 (Transitional measures concerning change in name of committee for rice field utilization direct payments)
(1) A committee for rice field utilization direct payments under previous Article 45 as at the time this Decree enters into force shall be deemed a committee for strategic crop direct payments under the amended provisions of Article 45.
(2) A person appointed or commissioned as a member of a committee for rice field utilization direct payments under previous Article 45 as at the time this Decree enters into force shall be deemed a member of a committee for strategic crop direct payments appointed or commissioned under the amended provisions of Article 45.
Article 3 (Transitional measures concerning restriction on making of rice field utilization direct payments and recovery thereof)
(1) Where a registrant of rice field utilization direct payments or a person to whom such payments are made under previous Article 49 as at the time this Decree enters into force falls under any of the subparagraphs of previous Article 50(1), the previous provisions shall apply to restriction on the making of rice field utilization direct payments and the recovery thereof, notwithstanding the amended provisions of Article 50(1).
(2) In applying the amended provisions of Article 50(2), a person to whom all of rice field utilization direct payments are not made or from whom such payments are recovered as he or she falls under previous Article 50(1)1 shall be deemed a person to whom all of strategic crop direct payments are not made or from whom such payments are recovered as he or she falls under the amended provisions of Article 50(1)1.
Article 4 Omitted.
Article 5 (Relationship to other statutes or regulations)
A citation of rice field utilization direct payments by other statutes or regulations as at the time this Decree enters into force shall be deemed a citation of strategic crop direct payments under this Decree in lieu thereof.

